# ==============================================================================
# /usr/lib/iscsi
# ==============================================================================
# This path is a directory containing library files and utilities for the
# libiscsi package on Red Hat-based systems. It is NOT a configuration file.
#
# Because it is a directory, it cannot be parametrized as a single configuration
# template. No Jinja2 directives are needed here.
#
# If you intended to configure the iSCSI initiator daemon, the configuration
# file is typically located at:
#   /etc/iscsi/iscsid.conf
#
# This file is left empty/blank as per the constraint that /usr/lib/iscsi is
# a directory.
